      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "review-note",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "none",
          "guid": "mrxayn2amic547xe",
          "message": {
            "text": "The \"clicking Open in Glassbox ▾ does nothing\" report was a CSS-cascade bug, not a Tauri no-op: the chooser's `display: flex` (author style) overrides the UA stylesheet's `[hidden] { display: none }`, so the menu rendered permanently open and the button's hidden-attribute toggle had no visible effect. The explicit `&[hidden] { display: none; }` restores the toggle. Regression protection lives in the e2e (Playwright asserts COMPUTED visibility — verified failing pre-fix); the unit test's attribute assertions are structurally blind to this class of bug (happy-dom applies no CSS cascade).",
            "markdown": "The \"clicking Open in Glassbox ▾ does nothing\" report was a CSS-cascade bug, not a Tauri no-op: the chooser's `display: flex` (author style) overrides the UA stylesheet's `[hidden] { display: none }`, so the menu rendered permanently open and the button's hidden-attribute toggle had no visible effect. The explicit `&[hidden] { display: none; }` restores the toggle. Regression protection lives in the e2e (Playwright asserts COMPUTED visibility — verified failing pre-fix); the unit test's attribute assertions are structurally blind to this class of bug (happy-dom applies no CSS cascade)."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/client/styles.scss"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 4557,
                  "endLine": 4560,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "  // HS-9400 — `display: flex` (author style) beats the UA's `[hidden] { display:\n  // none }`, so without this the menu rendered permanently open and the header\n  // button's hidden-attribute toggle visibly did nothing.\n  &[hidden] { display: none; }"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ]
          },
